      "diff": "@@ -55,23 +55,37 @@ The following features are either new or have been significantly updated since v\n // === Removed Dissectors\n \n \n-//=== New File Format Decoding Support\n+=== New File Format Decoding Support\n \n-//[commaize]\n-//--\n-//--\n+[commaize]\n+--\n+M-Module\n+--\n \n === New Protocol Support\n \n // Add one protocol per line between the -- delimiters in the format\n // “Full protocol name (Abbreviation)”\n-// git log --oneline --diff-filter=A --stat v4.3.0rc0.. epan/dissectors plugins\n+// git log --oneline --diff-filter=A --stat v4.7.0rc0.. epan/dissectors plugins\n [commaize]\n --\n+DCERPC SCARD_PACK\n+ESUN\n+Linux mac80211_hwsim Netlink\n+Mikrotik RoMON\n+Multicast Router Discovery (MRD)\n+NATS\n+NMEA 2000\n+Object Transform Protocol (OTP)\n+Perforce P4RPC\n+PosiStageNet (PSN)\n TrueConf Protocol (TrueConf)\n+RDP Conctrl virtual channel Protocol (CONCTRL)\n+RDP Video Capture Virtual Channel Extension (RDPECAM)\n Real-Time Tracking Protocol (RTTrP)\n-PosiStageNet (PSN)\n-Object Transform Protocol (OTP)\n+TrueConf\n+Ultra Ethernet Transport (UET)\n+ZigBee ZCL Generic Tunnel\n --\n \n === Updated Protocol Support\n",
